  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 734.08 Ski Tickets. Day-use and season ski tickets shall not be transferred, subject to refund, or resold. Purchase of a ski ticket shall allow only the original purchaser to use the facilities.\n\nSource. #14055 EMERGENCY, EXPIRED: 2-15-25\n\nNew. #14291, eff 6-25-25, EXPIRES: 6-25-35",
